# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# Zola build output. `/public/` too: `--output-dir` resolves against the working
# directory rather than `--root`, so a stray invocation lands it at the repo root.
site/public/
/public/

# Spec Kit: the feature specifications under `specs/`, the scaffolding that
# produces them (`/speckit-*` skills, templates) and the constitution under
# `.specify/memory/`. Same rule as `concepts/`: internal working documents, and
# nothing published may cite a path its reader does not have.
/specs/
/.specify/
/.claude/

# `scripts/verify_quotes.py` is run, not imported — its bytecode cache is a
# build artefact of whichever Python happened to run it, and one was committed.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Internal design notes (see concepts/README.md). Working documents: they quote
# the regulatory sources by clause and page, and record what each design
# decision cost. `site/` is the public narrative, `CHANGELOG.md` the history and
# the rustdoc the API contract; `concepts/` is none of the three, and nothing in
# the build reads it.
#
# The primary sources — BNetzA Festlegungen, BDEW/VKU/GEODE Leitfäden,
# EDI@Energy Codelisten, VDE FNN Hinweise, redistributed under their own terms —
# live at `concepts/reference/` and are covered by the same line: one ignored
# tree, one answer to "where does the evidence live". `concepts/REFERENCES.md`
# indexes them and `just references` rebuilds the folder from the index.
/concepts/
